# Caption
Instrumental melodic deep house, no vocals. Felt piano melody, slow analog pads, plucked synth arpeggio, deep warm sub bass, soft claps, rolling percussion. Nocturnal, cinematic, focused, wide reverb. Evolving arrangement: filtered intro, chords and lead enter gradually, a breakdown without kick, then a fuller groove; the melody develops instead of looping. Hi-fi studio mix, warm and clean. Instrumental only.

